# Shaped like the test fleet's Mac Pro (late 2013) on Ubuntu: two AMD FirePro
# D700 (Tahiti XT, 6 GiB each) on amdgpu, which KFD does not list (GCN 1), and
# a Xeon E5-1650 v2 without AVX2. Values chosen, not captured; the live run on
# the machine is the gate.
